## 📦 Installation

### From PyPI (recommended)
```bash
pip install quscope
```

### Development install
```bash
git clone https://github.com/QuScope/QuScope.git
cd QuScope
pip install -e ".[all]"
```

### IBM Quantum access (optional — for real hardware)
```bash
export IBMQ_TOKEN="YOUR_API_TOKEN"
```

